Z||000000||80's BOY||05-27-2001||04:29 PM||||hey guys. after all these years, my tranny blew and if i'm pulling out the cradle then it's time for an engine swap. since people who have done swaps know their cars well, they also know what they should have done or wish they would have done at the time. if i could go back, i'd never build another 3.1 even though my engine is very fast and reliable. it's simply not enough speed for me. so what would you do if YOUR cradle was empty again??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
