Z||000005||FierobearRoadtrip||05-27-2001||06:11 PM||||I just did a 3.4 into my Formula. As swaps go, it's pretty damn easy.<P>The way it worked out for me, financially, it would have cost around the same for a 3.1 rebuild. Why not have 20-30 extra horses?<P>When it comes to bang for the buck, it's hard to beat the pushrod 3.4.||||reg||1
