Z||000010||pherder||05-27-2001||10:30 PM||||I did a HO Quad 4, 5 speed into my 88 Coupe.<P>Too much trouble for what it does.<P>Spent as much $$ and time as it would of cost to put in a V8 or a supercharged 3800!  It just does not have any torque.<P>Horsepowerwise ... it screams!  But I am getting older and don't like having a screaming 4 cylinder right behind my head <B>ALL THE TIME!!!</B><P>That is why I am putting a TPI V8 with an overdrive automatic in my 86 SE.  <P><B>TORQUE!</B>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Gas mileage wise I will be losing a bunch (33+ highway for the Q4 and 29 city) but I expect around 25+ highway for the TPI w/overdrive.<P>Paul||||reg||13
Z||000011||lowCG||05-29-2001||10:51 PM||||A 401K,or Roth IRA perhaps.<BR>Really,I love my 3.4TDC though,just would stay away from $270 clutches that are made with a Kevlar race lining put onto a totally stock disc/hub(chattered to death in 3K).<BR>||||reg||1
